{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jumpcore\u00a0is a first-person precision platformer that combines momentum-based movement and collectathon progression within surreal, liminal environments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an exiled angel returning to the Origin after eons of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates stand open, yet no one answers. The light that once ruled this place has long since faded, and creation lies still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rekindle it, you must descend through the hollow structures left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don\u2019t stop moving. <strong>The silence is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/e337da975344c5b4fc8225b96284f2c3.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=495 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/e337da975344c5b4fc8225b96284f2c3.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain <strong>jumps</strong>,\u00a0<strong>slides</strong>, <strong>air dashes</strong>, and<strong> hooks</strong> to traverse surreal ruins and forgotten monuments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain <strong>powerful</strong> <strong>movement abilities</strong> that open new paths, reveal hidden zones in earlier stages, and unlock access to deeper realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>sacred shards </strong>and<strong> divine gems</strong> scattered through these abandoned realms to fuel  resurrection\u2026 or something far worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore haunting <strong>liminal spaces</strong>, forgotten alleys, silent snowfields, empty stations, and impossible skyscrapers stretching into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a world abandoned by its maker, chasing echoes of divinity through stillness, dust, and broken creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The silence breathes, and <strong>it remembers you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041490?t=1762474811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/a7ca9eccf4cbf9983fe3aed54eaaae4a3fe8061c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762474811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/f4291a2debdaab6634810cea6e5713edecf27728/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762474811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/f4291a2debdaab6634810cea6e5713edecf27728/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762474811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jumpcore\u00a0is a first-person precision platformer that combines momentum-based movement and collectathon progression within surreal, liminal environments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/59bf4d22d2d54c3eee33684c74f4fe98.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/cc4066e796502ea215f39765ce031c1e.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an exiled angel returning to the Origin after eons of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates stand open, yet no one answers. The light that once ruled this place has long since faded, and creation lies still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rekindle it, you must descend through the hollow structures left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don\u2019t stop moving. <strong>The silence is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/8c2cc1e6a5e91b1ce1a30583f2b19171.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/e337da975344c5b4fc8225b96284f2c3.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=495 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/e337da975344c5b4fc8225b96284f2c3.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain <strong>jumps</strong>,\u00a0<strong>slides</strong>, <strong>air dashes</strong>, and<strong> hooks</strong> to traverse surreal ruins and forgotten monuments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain <strong>powerful</strong> <strong>movement abilities</strong> that open new paths, reveal hidden zones in earlier stages, and unlock access to deeper realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>sacred shards </strong>and<strong> divine gems</strong> scattered through these abandoned realms to fuel  resurrection\u2026 or something far worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/9358b3333941ac6653a287cde1862905.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.poster.avif?t=1762474811\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.webm?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/extras/c41342d9b45e70201d3752b0a7fab522.mp4?t=1762474811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore haunting <strong>liminal spaces</strong>, forgotten alleys, silent snowfields, empty stations, and impossible skyscrapers stretching into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a world abandoned by its maker, chasing echoes of divinity through stillness, dust, and broken creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The silence breathes, and <strong>it remembers you.</strong></p>","developers":["Hauntysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041490/f1c637d8e1aad6f3bdc5b2360ea6dbc5cb152d30/header.jpg?t=1762474811","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041490/1453904618/2f095b2a874ffa2426e4410b357fddad1f0c1799/1762137757/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762474741","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041490/1453904618/2f095b2a874ffa2426e4410b357fddad1f0c1799/1762137757/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762474741","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041490/1453904618/2f095b2a874ffa2426e4410b357fddad1f0c1799/1762137757/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762474741","id":257225925,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225925/movie480.mp4?t=1762474741","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225925/movie_max.mp4?t=1762474741"},"name":"Jumpcore - Reveal Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225925/fb306c4257dff05f97da836c219e9a99b2ea090e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762474741","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225925/movie480.webm?t=1762474741","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225925/movie_max.webm?t=1762474741"}}],"name":"Jumpcore","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core Processor Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li